*** Settings ***
Documentation            [SUITE PURPOSE]  CB007487 - ABIP integration part UTE Cloud introduction
...
...               Scope : 1/ chain a SA ans a NSA call in a same test
...                       2/ be as simple as possible without any confguration file modification during the test to be  
...                          able to validate golden config file delivered on UTE via single run UTE mechanism
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : francois.tourlonnias@nokia.com
...               Test Case Scenario contact  : francois.tourlonnias@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation contact: laurent.paillasse@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 2022/06/19
...               Last Modified               : 2022/11/23 francois.tourlonnias@nokia.com - UL traffic value adaptation to 1x1 Mimo Abip Restriction

Resource            ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/GenericTest.robot
Resource            ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/CallSetup.robot
Resource            ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Restart.robot
Resource            ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Traffic.robot
Resource            ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Setup.robot

Resource            resources/robot/CB007487_PerfKPI_Keywords.robot    #for UL traffic Check adaptation

Library             taf.wts.runner              WITH NAME       wtsemu
Library             taf.transport.ssh           WITH NAME       ssh

Suite Setup         Suite Setup From Scratch
Suite Teardown      Suite Teardown
Test Teardown       Teardown_CB007487_SA_NSA_introutecloud

Force Tags          CA_5G_SW_FR-Villarceaux    RRM
...                 PY36
...                 CONFIGURED    5G_RAN    RAN_5G

*** Variables ***

# variable set to ${True} to automatically save SOS report and OAM snapshot
# (by default, these information are saved only if a test is failed)
${AutoSaveDebugData}        ${False}

&{TDD_4T4R_2x2MIMO}
...                                 Downlink_throughput=211   # Mbps
...                                 Uplink_throughput=70      # Mbps
...                                 celltype=TDD

&{FDD_4T4R_2x2MIMO}
...                                 Downlink_throughput=184    # Mbps
...                                 Uplink_throughput=79       # Mbps
...                                 celltype=FDD
